CSIPHY v1.2.2 fix for qcom-camss on SM7125 (sm7125-mainline/linux tag sm7125-6.14.7).
The lane table and the two PHY-enable writes are asidko's fix
(https://github.com/asidko/qcom-camss-mainline), the table transcribed from Xiaomi's GPL kernel
(MiCode/Xiaomi_Kernel_OpenSource, curtana-q-oss, cam_csiphy_1_2_2_hwreg.h). Their patch file
doesn't apply as published (a context line lacks its leading space); this is the same change as a
clean diff. Apply from the kernel tree's root with: patch -p1 < camss-csiphy-fix.patch

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
